  "oreModifiers": {
    "notes": [
      "When Fire and Frost get applied to the same ore, the ore gets destroyed.",
      "Cosmetic means it does nothing by itself, it just adds that look to the ore (some items still check for it).",
      "Unlike effects, only 1 material can be on an ore at a time, so applying a new material replaces whatever material the ore already had (right now: Neon removes Sandy, and Sandy removes Neon)."
